{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/logoooname-whitefig.png?t=1743455942\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>WELCOME CHRONONAUT!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Across the Gap</strong> is an <strong>open-world adventure building game</strong> supporting up to 4 players. You will travel through time and face challenges requiring creative solutions. Equipped with an all-in-one Multitool, you can build simple or intricate designs! Throughout your adventure, you will meet many colorful characters and explore detailed worlds. It's time to start your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/ATG_GIF-6-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1743455942\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Journey through time to visit various open-world locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/ATG_GIF-2-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1743455942\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Plan and build functional machines to complete challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/ATG_GIF-3-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1743455942\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Converse with characters in a dynamic, lived-in world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578190/extras/ATG_GIF-4-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1743455942\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Travel solo or as a group of up to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.